  ('60e0c419-a5b7-4f73-80a4-3e874717b727', 'signature-crew-neck-tee-mte001', 'Signature Crew Neck Tee', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Signature Crew Neck Tee pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, never bulky. Made from cotton, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Clean seaming, a reinforced hem, and minimal branding keep the focus on the cut. A dependable piece for regular wear, built to outlast a single season. Machine wash cold with like colors; tumble dry low.', 'XR-MTE-001', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000011', ARRAY['essential','limited']::text[], 'Signature Crew Neck Tee | X-Rare', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Signature Crew Neck Tee pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette cle', now());
