  ('567fe231-eef8-42fe-b8de-f0b0ba383234', 'minimal-logo-tee-mte006', 'Minimal Logo Tee', 'The Minimal Logo Tee takes a familiar silhouette and refines it with careful proportions. Tailored through the waist and hip for a fit that reads polished rather than fussy. Made from cotton, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Clean seaming, a reinforced hem, and minimal branding keep the focus on the cut. Layer it into a full look or let it stand on its own; either way it holds its shape. Machine wash cold, hang to dry.', 'XR-MTE-006', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000011', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Minimal Logo Tee | X-Rare', 'The Minimal Logo Tee takes a familiar silhouette and refines it with careful proportions. Tailored through the waist and hip for a fit that reads polished ', now());
