  ('b1305632-596b-444f-a045-6736825d9a0b', 'boxy-drop-shoulder-tee-mte007', 'Boxy Drop-Shoulder Tee', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Boxy Drop-Shoulder Tee pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straight body for an easy, unforced fit. Made from cotton blend, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Clean seaming, a reinforced hem, and minimal branding keep the focus on the cut. A dependable piece for regular wear, built to outlast a single season. Machine wash cold with like colors; tumble dry low.', 'XR-MTE-007', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000011', ARRAY['oversized','sale']::text[], 'Boxy Drop-Shoulder Tee | X-Rare', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Boxy Drop-Shoulder Tee pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a s', now());
