  ('383a9caf-d718-4c86-85d2-dc969b393130', 'garment-dyed-tee-mte009', 'Garment-Dyed Tee', 'The Garment-Dyed Tee brings a considered, easy confidence to everyday dressing. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straight body for an easy, unforced fit. Made from pima cotton, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. A reinforced neckline and double-stitched seams are built to handle daily wear. A dependable piece for regular wear, built to outlast a single season. Spot clean or dry clean recommended to preserve shape and color.', 'XR-MTE-009', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000011', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Garment-Dyed Tee | X-Rare', 'The Garment-Dyed Tee brings a considered, easy confidence to everyday dressing. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straight body for an easy, unfor', now());
