  ('402be665-c926-4001-a532-519375206119', 'acid-wash-graphic-tee-mte011', 'Acid Wash Graphic Tee', 'The Acid Wash Graphic Tee brings a considered, easy confidence to everyday dressing. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, never bulky. Made from cotton, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. A reinforced neckline and double-stitched seams are built to handle daily wear. Wear it as the foundation of an everyday look or dress it up for something more considered. Machine wash cold with like colors; tumble dry low.', 'XR-MTE-011', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000011', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Acid Wash Graphic Tee | X-Rare', 'The Acid Wash Graphic Tee brings a considered, easy confidence to everyday dressing. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, never bu', now());
