  ('4397f546-b4c3-4253-ae8c-98b439281c95', 'striped-crew-tee-mte013', 'Striped Crew Tee', 'The Striped Crew Tee brings a considered, easy confidence to everyday dressing. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straight body for an easy, unforced fit. Made from slub cotton, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Flat-felled seams and a clean interior finish reflect the attention paid to construction most people never see. Layer it into a full look or let it stand on its own; either way it holds its shape. Machine wash cold with like colors; tumble dry low.', 'XR-MTE-013', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000011', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Striped Crew Tee | X-Rare', 'The Striped Crew Tee brings a considered, easy confidence to everyday dressing. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straight body for an easy, unfor', now());
