  ('9d6e294e-da1f-4eb1-a044-96396df40341', 'raw-edge-tee-mte016', 'Raw Edge Tee', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Raw Edge Tee pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. An oversized cut through the body gives room to move while keeping the silhouette deliberate, not sloppy. Made from cotton, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Subtle contrast stitching and a tonal interior label round out the construction. Layer it into a full look or let it stand on its own; either way it holds its shape. Machine wash cold with like colors; tumble dry low.', 'XR-MTE-016', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000011', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Raw Edge Tee | X-Rare', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Raw Edge Tee pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. An oversized cut through the body gives room to move w', now());
