  ('dc530b96-5ea9-42ef-b4fa-e6f80e8fb908', 'double-layer-tee-mte017', 'Double Layer Tee', 'Designed with intention, the Double Layer Tee balances clean lines with real wearability. Tailored through the waist and hip for a fit that reads polished rather than fussy. Made from cotton blend, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Subtle contrast stitching and a tonal interior label round out the construction. Layer it into a full look or let it stand on its own; either way it holds its shape. Hand wash cold and lay flat to dry to keep its finish.', 'XR-MTE-017', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000011', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Double Layer Tee | X-Rare', 'Designed with intention, the Double Layer Tee balances clean lines with real wearability. Tailored through the waist and hip for a fit that reads polished ', now());
