  ('316188db-2dfb-4b53-85cf-70277e280112', 'mesh-panel-tee-mte018', 'Mesh Panel Tee', 'The Mesh Panel Tee takes a familiar silhouette and refines it with careful proportions. An oversized cut through the body gives room to move while keeping the silhouette deliberate, not sloppy. Made from slub cotton, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Clean seaming, a reinforced hem, and minimal branding keep the focus on the cut. Layer it into a full look or let it stand on its own; either way it holds its shape. Machine wash cold with like colors; tumble dry low.', 'XR-MTE-018', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000011', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Mesh Panel Tee | X-Rare', 'The Mesh Panel Tee takes a familiar silhouette and refines it with careful proportions. An oversized cut through the body gives room to move while keeping ', now());
