  ('b6c14e4c-1cc3-4831-a876-ca659ef485f7', 'embroidered-chest-tee-mte019', 'Embroidered Chest Tee', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Embroidered Chest Tee pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, never bulky. Made from pima cotton, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Flat-felled seams and a clean interior finish reflect the attention paid to construction most people never see. A dependable piece for regular wear, built to outlast a single season. Hand wash cold and lay flat to dry to keep its finish.', 'XR-MTE-019', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000011', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Embroidered Chest Tee | X-Rare', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Embroidered Chest Tee pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean', now());
