  ('8902380c-51a8-4597-9304-0ed0a00d9ad8', 'muscle-fit-tee-mte020', 'Muscle Fit Tee', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Muscle Fit Tee pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, never bulky. Made from organic cotton, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Considered hardware and a tonal color palette keep the piece easy to style. Layer it into a full look or let it stand on its own; either way it holds its shape. Hand wash cold and lay flat to dry to keep its finish.', 'XR-MTE-020', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000011', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Muscle Fit Tee | X-Rare', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Muscle Fit Tee pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and co', now());
