  ('becebf28-532e-402a-8be7-b6ecdb362ddb', 'slim-taper-denim-mdn001', 'Slim Taper Denim', 'The Slim Taper Denim takes a familiar silhouette and refines it with careful proportions. An oversized cut through the body gives room to move while keeping the silhouette deliberate, not sloppy. Made from denim, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Considered hardware and a tonal color palette keep the piece easy to style. Layer it into a full look or let it stand on its own; either way it holds its shape. Machine wash cold with like colors; tumble dry low.', 'XR-MDN-001', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000012', ARRAY['slim','sale','limited']::text[], 'Slim Taper Denim | X-Rare', 'The Slim Taper Denim takes a familiar silhouette and refines it with careful proportions. An oversized cut through the body gives room to move while keepin', now());
