  ('ef2eedbe-eaac-46e6-b401-b213a0bb10de', 'relaxed-straight-denim-mdn002', 'Relaxed Straight Denim', 'The Relaxed Straight Denim takes a familiar silhouette and refines it with careful proportions. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straight body for an easy, unforced fit. Made from stretch denim, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Subtle contrast stitching and a tonal interior label round out the construction. It''s built for rotation — as comfortable running errands as it is out for the evening. Machine wash cold, hang to dry.', 'XR-MDN-002', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000012', ARRAY['relaxed','limited']::text[], 'Relaxed Straight Denim | X-Rare', 'The Relaxed Straight Denim takes a familiar silhouette and refines it with careful proportions. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straight body fo', now());
