  ('28a1ae54-66ce-4a28-b78a-5c032d658c42', 'distressed-denim-mdn004', 'Distressed Denim', 'Designed with intention, the Distressed Denim balances clean lines with real wearability. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straight body for an easy, unforced fit. Made from selvedge denim, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Clean seaming, a reinforced hem, and minimal branding keep the focus on the cut. A dependable piece for regular wear, built to outlast a single season. Spot clean or dry clean recommended to preserve shape and color.', 'XR-MDN-004', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000012', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Distressed Denim | X-Rare', 'Designed with intention, the Distressed Denim balances clean lines with real wearability. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straight body for an e', now());
