  ('0cfd8fb6-32b2-4623-ab11-a03bf33be13c', 'raw-selvedge-denim-mdn005', 'Raw Selvedge Denim', 'The Raw Selvedge Denim takes a familiar silhouette and refines it with careful proportions. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, never bulky. Made from denim, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Considered hardware and a tonal color palette keep the piece easy to style. A dependable piece for regular wear, built to outlast a single season. Machine wash cold, hang to dry.', 'XR-MDN-005', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000012', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Raw Selvedge Denim | X-Rare', 'The Raw Selvedge Denim takes a familiar silhouette and refines it with careful proportions. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, n', now());
