  ('87df5592-e211-4727-bac3-8be5cf2142ec', 'black-coated-denim-mdn007', 'Black Coated Denim', 'The Black Coated Denim takes a familiar silhouette and refines it with careful proportions. An oversized cut through the body gives room to move while keeping the silhouette deliberate, not sloppy. Made from rigid denim, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. A reinforced neckline and double-stitched seams are built to handle daily wear. Layer it into a full look or let it stand on its own; either way it holds its shape. Machine wash cold with like colors; tumble dry low.', 'XR-MDN-007', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000012', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Black Coated Denim | X-Rare', 'The Black Coated Denim takes a familiar silhouette and refines it with careful proportions. An oversized cut through the body gives room to move while keep', now());
