  ('9b2b284c-8f44-428f-a690-dec2b1c709c6', 'skinny-stretch-denim-mdn009', 'Skinny Stretch Denim', 'Designed with intention, the Skinny Stretch Denim balances clean lines with real wearability. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, never bulky. Made from denim, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Considered hardware and a tonal color palette keep the piece easy to style. Layer it into a full look or let it stand on its own; either way it holds its shape. Spot clean or dry clean recommended to preserve shape and color.', 'XR-MDN-009', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000012', ARRAY['slim']::text[], 'Skinny Stretch Denim | X-Rare', 'Designed with intention, the Skinny Stretch Denim balances clean lines with real wearability. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered,', now());
