  ('94a46621-3572-4350-9af9-1e5aa5f40deb', 'cropped-ankle-denim-mdn012', 'Cropped Ankle Denim', 'The Cropped Ankle Denim brings a considered, easy confidence to everyday dressing. Tailored through the waist and hip for a fit that reads polished rather than fussy. Made from selvedge denim, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Clean seaming, a reinforced hem, and minimal branding keep the focus on the cut. Layer it into a full look or let it stand on its own; either way it holds its shape. Hand wash cold and lay flat to dry to keep its finish.', 'XR-MDN-012', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000012', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Cropped Ankle Denim | X-Rare', 'The Cropped Ankle Denim brings a considered, easy confidence to everyday dressing. Tailored through the waist and hip for a fit that reads polished rather ', now());
