  ('8c1fd39c-5b89-4124-9f62-3399cdb29013', 'patchwork-denim-mdn013', 'Patchwork Denim', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Patchwork Denim moves easily from day to night. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, never bulky. Made from denim, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Considered hardware and a tonal color palette keep the piece easy to style. A dependable piece for regular wear, built to outlast a single season. Spot clean or dry clean recommended to preserve shape and color.', 'XR-MDN-013', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000012', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Patchwork Denim | X-Rare', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Patchwork Denim moves easily from day to night. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, nev', now());
