  ('aad2dfaa-4250-480e-9eae-78a723270e6c', 'bootcut-denim-mdn014', 'Bootcut Denim', 'The Bootcut Denim takes a familiar silhouette and refines it with careful proportions. Tailored through the waist and hip for a fit that reads polished rather than fussy. Made from stretch denim, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Subtle contrast stitching and a tonal interior label round out the construction. A dependable piece for regular wear, built to outlast a single season. Hand wash cold and lay flat to dry to keep its finish.', 'XR-MDN-014', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000012', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Bootcut Denim | X-Rare', 'The Bootcut Denim takes a familiar silhouette and refines it with careful proportions. Tailored through the waist and hip for a fit that reads polished rat', now());
