  ('07430d8a-856d-478e-a814-e0a2330073f0', 'acid-wash-denim-mdn015', 'Acid Wash Denim', 'The Acid Wash Denim brings a considered, easy confidence to everyday dressing. Tailored through the waist and hip for a fit that reads polished rather than fussy. Made from rigid denim, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. A reinforced neckline and double-stitched seams are built to handle daily wear. It''s built for rotation — as comfortable running errands as it is out for the evening. Machine wash cold with like colors; tumble dry low.', 'XR-MDN-015', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000012', ARRAY['sale']::text[], 'Acid Wash Denim | X-Rare', 'The Acid Wash Denim brings a considered, easy confidence to everyday dressing. Tailored through the waist and hip for a fit that reads polished rather than', now());
