  ('22fa93fb-8417-4660-bfa8-130768ac3ba2', 'bomber-jacket-mjk001', 'Bomber Jacket', 'The Bomber Jacket takes a familiar silhouette and refines it with careful proportions. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straight body for an easy, unforced fit. Made from nylon, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Considered hardware and a tonal color palette keep the piece easy to style. It''s built for rotation — as comfortable running errands as it is out for the evening. Machine wash cold, hang to dry.', 'XR-MJK-001', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000013', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Bomber Jacket | X-Rare', 'The Bomber Jacket takes a familiar silhouette and refines it with careful proportions. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straight body for an easy', now());
