  ('27069a4c-0ea9-45b9-bfe7-96df5e3e4541', 'denim-trucker-jacket-mjk002', 'Denim Trucker Jacket', 'Designed with intention, the Denim Trucker Jacket balances clean lines with real wearability. The fit is relaxed through the body without feeling oversized, so it layers cleanly under outerwear or stands alone. Made from cotton twill, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Subtle contrast stitching and a tonal interior label round out the construction. It''s built for rotation — as comfortable running errands as it is out for the evening. Machine wash cold, hang to dry.', 'XR-MJK-002', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000013', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Denim Trucker Jacket | X-Rare', 'Designed with intention, the Denim Trucker Jacket balances clean lines with real wearability. The fit is relaxed through the body without feeling oversized', now());
