  ('71f6301f-2edf-44d8-9755-b527f64839a2', 'nylon-track-jacket-mjk012', 'Nylon Track Jacket', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Nylon Track Jacket pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straight body for an easy, unforced fit. Made from wool blend, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Considered hardware and a tonal color palette keep the piece easy to style. Layer it into a full look or let it stand on its own; either way it holds its shape. Spot clean or dry clean recommended to preserve shape and color.', 'XR-MJK-012', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000013', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Nylon Track Jacket | X-Rare', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Nylon Track Jacket pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a strai', now());
