  ('220f2051-18df-4542-a712-42e3df642640', 'reversible-jacket-mjk015', 'Reversible Jacket', 'The Reversible Jacket brings a considered, easy confidence to everyday dressing. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straight body for an easy, unforced fit. Made from leather, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Flat-felled seams and a clean interior finish reflect the attention paid to construction most people never see. A dependable piece for regular wear, built to outlast a single season. Hand wash cold and lay flat to dry to keep its finish.', 'XR-MJK-015', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000013', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Reversible Jacket | X-Rare', 'The Reversible Jacket brings a considered, easy confidence to everyday dressing. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straight body for an easy, unfo', now());
