  ('c0cebe80-3154-4ce7-b370-405a0537a01d', 'washed-vintage-hoodie-mhd004', 'Washed Vintage Hoodie', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Washed Vintage Hoodie moves easily from day to night. An oversized cut through the body gives room to move while keeping the silhouette deliberate, not sloppy. Made from french terry, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Considered hardware and a tonal color palette keep the piece easy to style. Wear it as the foundation of an everyday look or dress it up for something more considered. Machine wash cold, hang to dry.', 'XR-MHD-004', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000014', ARRAY['streetwear']::text[], 'Washed Vintage Hoodie | X-Rare', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Washed Vintage Hoodie moves easily from day to night. An oversized cut through the body gives room to move while ', now());
