  ('91b7c25a-7273-4edb-9e25-891e9db76a5b', 'sherpa-lined-hoodie-mhd005', 'Sherpa-Lined Hoodie', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Sherpa-Lined Hoodie pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. An oversized cut through the body gives room to move while keeping the silhouette deliberate, not sloppy. Made from cotton fleece, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Clean seaming, a reinforced hem, and minimal branding keep the focus on the cut. Wear it as the foundation of an everyday look or dress it up for something more considered. Hand wash cold and lay flat to dry to keep its finish.', 'XR-MHD-005', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000014', ARRAY['streetwear']::text[], 'Sherpa-Lined Hoodie | X-Rare', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Sherpa-Lined Hoodie pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. An oversized cut through the body gives room to', now());
