  ('e02b7d84-eca1-46d1-9c1c-31113c58102e', 'half-zip-hoodie-mhd009', 'Half-Zip Hoodie', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Half-Zip Hoodie moves easily from day to night. An oversized cut through the body gives room to move while keeping the silhouette deliberate, not sloppy. Made from cotton fleece, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Subtle contrast stitching and a tonal interior label round out the construction. Layer it into a full look or let it stand on its own; either way it holds its shape. Machine wash cold, hang to dry.', 'XR-MHD-009', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000014', ARRAY['streetwear']::text[], 'Half-Zip Hoodie | X-Rare', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Half-Zip Hoodie moves easily from day to night. An oversized cut through the body gives room to move while keepin', now());
