  ('c1a51e00-47a8-4926-92bf-56f2961fade9', 'waffle-knit-hoodie-mhd011', 'Waffle Knit Hoodie', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Waffle Knit Hoodie pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. The fit is relaxed through the body without feeling oversized, so it layers cleanly under outerwear or stands alone. Made from cotton blend, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Clean seaming, a reinforced hem, and minimal branding keep the focus on the cut. Layer it into a full look or let it stand on its own; either way it holds its shape. Spot clean or dry clean recommended to preserve shape and color.', 'XR-MHD-011', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000014', ARRAY['streetwear','limited']::text[], 'Waffle Knit Hoodie | X-Rare', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Waffle Knit Hoodie pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. The fit is relaxed through the body without feel', now());
