  ('b62f4e82-c337-41a3-87fb-8a0111ae7a24', 'reflective-logo-hoodie-mhd016', 'Reflective Logo Hoodie', 'Designed with intention, the Reflective Logo Hoodie balances clean lines with real wearability. Tailored through the waist and hip for a fit that reads polished rather than fussy. Made from french terry, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Considered hardware and a tonal color palette keep the piece easy to style. A dependable piece for regular wear, built to outlast a single season. Spot clean or dry clean recommended to preserve shape and color.', 'XR-MHD-016', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000014', ARRAY['streetwear']::text[], 'Reflective Logo Hoodie | X-Rare', 'Designed with intention, the Reflective Logo Hoodie balances clean lines with real wearability. Tailored through the waist and hip for a fit that reads pol', now());
