  ('9d9184da-8e07-4181-93d8-eeac88203e2d', 'layered-panel-hoodie-mhd017', 'Layered Panel Hoodie', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Layered Panel Hoodie pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. Tailored through the waist and hip for a fit that reads polished rather than fussy. Made from cotton fleece, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Subtle contrast stitching and a tonal interior label round out the construction. A dependable piece for regular wear, built to outlast a single season. Machine wash cold, hang to dry.', 'XR-MHD-017', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000014', ARRAY['streetwear']::text[], 'Layered Panel Hoodie | X-Rare', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Layered Panel Hoodie pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. Tailored through the waist and hip for a fit t', now());
