  ('a93fda7a-1769-45d0-bbb3-b1dc073c9909', 'tailored-wide-leg-trouser-mpn001', 'Tailored Wide-Leg Trouser', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Tailored Wide-Leg Trouser pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straight body for an easy, unforced fit. Made from cotton twill, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Flat-felled seams and a clean interior finish reflect the attention paid to construction most people never see. A dependable piece for regular wear, built to outlast a single season. Hand wash cold and lay flat to dry to keep its finish.', 'XR-MPN-001', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000031', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Tailored Wide-Leg Trouser | X-Rare', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Tailored Wide-Leg Trouser pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and ', now());
