  ('7fb0e5c4-646f-4948-b57e-45690328772e', 'signature-cargo-pant-mpn002', 'Signature Cargo Pant', 'The Signature Cargo Pant takes a familiar silhouette and refines it with careful proportions. An oversized cut through the body gives room to move while keeping the silhouette deliberate, not sloppy. Made from wool blend, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. A reinforced neckline and double-stitched seams are built to handle daily wear. It''s built for rotation — as comfortable running errands as it is out for the evening. Machine wash cold, hang to dry.', 'XR-MPN-002', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000031', ARRAY['essential','sale']::text[], 'Signature Cargo Pant | X-Rare', 'The Signature Cargo Pant takes a familiar silhouette and refines it with careful proportions. An oversized cut through the body gives room to move while ke', now());
