  ('478c118f-4541-4c62-a82e-471c95c985ac', 'relaxed-chino-mpn003', 'Relaxed Chino', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Relaxed Chino moves easily from day to night. The fit is relaxed through the body without feeling oversized, so it layers cleanly under outerwear or stands alone. Made from nylon, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. A reinforced neckline and double-stitched seams are built to handle daily wear. Layer it into a full look or let it stand on its own; either way it holds its shape. Machine wash cold with like colors; tumble dry low.', 'XR-MPN-003', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000031', ARRAY['relaxed']::text[], 'Relaxed Chino | X-Rare', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Relaxed Chino moves easily from day to night. The fit is relaxed through the body without feeling oversized, so i', now());
