  ('c5adce40-fb68-4557-abf9-77cdf51627b7', 'nylon-utility-pant-mpn006', 'Nylon Utility Pant', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Nylon Utility Pant moves easily from day to night. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, never bulky. Made from cotton twill, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Subtle contrast stitching and a tonal interior label round out the construction. Wear it as the foundation of an everyday look or dress it up for something more considered. Machine wash cold, hang to dry.', 'XR-MPN-006', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000031', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Nylon Utility Pant | X-Rare', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Nylon Utility Pant moves easily from day to night. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, ', now());
