  ('f3b6f714-f71b-43af-812f-54b7182ffc9f', 'straight-leg-chino-mpn008', 'Straight Leg Chino', 'The Straight Leg Chino brings a considered, easy confidence to everyday dressing. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, never bulky. Made from nylon, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Subtle contrast stitching and a tonal interior label round out the construction. Wear it as the foundation of an everyday look or dress it up for something more considered. Spot clean or dry clean recommended to preserve shape and color.', 'XR-MPN-008', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000031', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Straight Leg Chino | X-Rare', 'The Straight Leg Chino brings a considered, easy confidence to everyday dressing. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, never bulky', now());
