  ('fa7ea16a-5d96-440a-aa21-1033d480f70b', 'track-pant-mpn009', 'Track Pant', 'Designed with intention, the Track Pant balances clean lines with real wearability. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straight body for an easy, unforced fit. Made from corduroy, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Subtle contrast stitching and a tonal interior label round out the construction. Wear it as the foundation of an everyday look or dress it up for something more considered. Machine wash cold, hang to dry.', 'XR-MPN-009', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000031', ARRAY['sale']::text[], 'Track Pant | X-Rare', 'Designed with intention, the Track Pant balances clean lines with real wearability. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straight body for an easy, u', now());
