  ('40930d8e-4b36-4d22-9ff9-d46c30edfe78', 'wool-blend-trouser-mpn011', 'Wool Blend Trouser', 'The Wool Blend Trouser brings a considered, easy confidence to everyday dressing. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, never bulky. Made from cotton twill, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Clean seaming, a reinforced hem, and minimal branding keep the focus on the cut. A dependable piece for regular wear, built to outlast a single season. Hand wash cold and lay flat to dry to keep its finish.', 'XR-MPN-011', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000031', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Wool Blend Trouser | X-Rare', 'The Wool Blend Trouser brings a considered, easy confidence to everyday dressing. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, never bulky', now());
