  ('9c617f70-0466-4cc9-b1c9-46a42115d1ce', 'cropped-trouser-mpn012', 'Cropped Trouser', 'Designed with intention, the Cropped Trouser balances clean lines with real wearability. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straight body for an easy, unforced fit. Made from wool blend, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Considered hardware and a tonal color palette keep the piece easy to style. Layer it into a full look or let it stand on its own; either way it holds its shape. Spot clean or dry clean recommended to preserve shape and color.', 'XR-MPN-012', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000031', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Cropped Trouser | X-Rare', 'Designed with intention, the Cropped Trouser balances clean lines with real wearability. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straight body for an ea', now());
