  ('9000ee54-0f65-4c05-a213-99b993082424', 'ribbed-panel-tracksuit-mts004', 'Ribbed Panel Tracksuit', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Ribbed Panel Tracksuit moves easily from day to night. The fit is relaxed through the body without feeling oversized, so it layers cleanly under outerwear or stands alone. Made from ribbed knit, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Clean seaming, a reinforced hem, and minimal branding keep the focus on the cut. It''s built for rotation — as comfortable running errands as it is out for the evening. Machine wash cold, hang to dry.', 'XR-MTS-004', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000032', ARRAY['streetwear']::text[], 'Ribbed Panel Tracksuit | X-Rare', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Ribbed Panel Tracksuit moves easily from day to night. The fit is relaxed through the body without feeling oversi', now());
