  ('27865f45-9b60-4a66-9280-3515b2c98864', 'velour-tracksuit-mts006', 'Velour Tracksuit', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Velour Tracksuit moves easily from day to night. The fit is relaxed through the body without feeling oversized, so it layers cleanly under outerwear or stands alone. Made from cotton fleece, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Considered hardware and a tonal color palette keep the piece easy to style. A dependable piece for regular wear, built to outlast a single season. Spot clean or dry clean recommended to preserve shape and color.', 'XR-MTS-006', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000032', ARRAY['streetwear']::text[], 'Velour Tracksuit | X-Rare', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Velour Tracksuit moves easily from day to night. The fit is relaxed through the body without feeling oversized, s', now());
