  ('668995bd-e504-4123-b80c-05daf564772d', 'long-trench-coat-mow002', 'Long Trench Coat', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Long Trench Coat moves easily from day to night. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, never bulky. Made from down fill, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. A reinforced neckline and double-stitched seams are built to handle daily wear. A dependable piece for regular wear, built to outlast a single season. Machine wash cold, hang to dry.', 'XR-MOW-002', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000033', ARRAY['premium']::text[], 'Long Trench Coat | X-Rare', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Long Trench Coat moves easily from day to night. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, ne', now());
