  ('8b674f88-d7b5-49a6-8161-80c7cc42b683', 'down-filled-parka-mow005', 'Down-Filled Parka', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Down-Filled Parka pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straight body for an easy, unforced fit. Made from technical nylon, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Flat-felled seams and a clean interior finish reflect the attention paid to construction most people never see. A dependable piece for regular wear, built to outlast a single season. Machine wash cold, hang to dry.', 'XR-MOW-005', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000033', ARRAY['premium','sale']::text[], 'Down-Filled Parka | X-Rare', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Down-Filled Parka pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straig', now());
