  ('02342cda-4512-42b7-8f24-c275ae5ecb97', 'double-breasted-overcoat-mow006', 'Double-Breasted Overcoat', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Double-Breasted Overcoat pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. An oversized cut through the body gives room to move while keeping the silhouette deliberate, not sloppy. Made from wool blend, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Clean seaming, a reinforced hem, and minimal branding keep the focus on the cut. Wear it as the foundation of an everyday look or dress it up for something more considered. Machine wash cold with like colors; tumble dry low.', 'XR-MOW-006', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000033', ARRAY['premium']::text[], 'Double-Breasted Overcoat | X-Rare', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Double-Breasted Overcoat pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. An oversized cut through the body gives ro', now());
