  ('215e5ae5-5f25-48ca-83cd-ed94445973ca', 'puff-sleeve-blouse-wtp006', 'Puff Sleeve Blouse', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Puff Sleeve Blouse pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, never bulky. Made from cotton blend, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Flat-felled seams and a clean interior finish reflect the attention paid to construction most people never see. Layer it into a full look or let it stand on its own; either way it holds its shape. Machine wash cold with like colors; tumble dry low.', 'XR-WTP-006', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000021', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Puff Sleeve Blouse | X-Rare', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Puff Sleeve Blouse pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean an', now());
