  ('0664532d-185b-498a-a853-268990181066', 'linen-button-up-top-wtp011', 'Linen Button-Up Top', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Linen Button-Up Top pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, never bulky. Made from mesh, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. A reinforced neckline and double-stitched seams are built to handle daily wear. It''s built for rotation — as comfortable running errands as it is out for the evening. Hand wash cold and lay flat to dry to keep its finish.', 'XR-WTP-011', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000021', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Linen Button-Up Top | X-Rare', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Linen Button-Up Top pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean a', now());
