  ('5be78bf2-eea9-4581-8891-a7a2935ddfbc', 'one-shoulder-top-wtp014', 'One-Shoulder Top', 'Designed with intention, the One-Shoulder Top balances clean lines with real wearability. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straight body for an easy, unforced fit. Made from silk blend, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Considered hardware and a tonal color palette keep the piece easy to style. It''s built for rotation — as comfortable running errands as it is out for the evening. Machine wash cold, hang to dry.', 'XR-WTP-014', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000021', ARRAY['sale']::text[], 'One-Shoulder Top | X-Rare', 'Designed with intention, the One-Shoulder Top balances clean lines with real wearability. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straight body for an e', now());
