  ('dcc3ecc2-37fe-4baf-be16-52e457765806', 'square-neck-top-wtp018', 'Square Neck Top', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Square Neck Top pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, never bulky. Made from cotton blend, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. A reinforced neckline and double-stitched seams are built to handle daily wear. Layer it into a full look or let it stand on its own; either way it holds its shape. Hand wash cold and lay flat to dry to keep its finish.', 'XR-WTP-018', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000021', ARRAY['limited']::text[], 'Square Neck Top | X-Rare', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Square Neck Top pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and c', now());
