  ('1e52d1e8-5a68-4ddc-ac1e-3b51e57af830', 'twist-front-top-wtp019', 'Twist Front Top', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Twist Front Top pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. An oversized cut through the body gives room to move while keeping the silhouette deliberate, not sloppy. Made from satin, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Considered hardware and a tonal color palette keep the piece easy to style. Wear it as the foundation of an everyday look or dress it up for something more considered. Spot clean or dry clean recommended to preserve shape and color.', 'XR-WTP-019', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000021', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Twist Front Top | X-Rare', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Twist Front Top pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. An oversized cut through the body gives room to mov', now());
