  ('5f577c04-9de0-4fcb-bd63-ddac481d2c75', 'turtleneck-knit-top-wtp020', 'Turtleneck Knit Top', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Turtleneck Knit Top moves easily from day to night. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, never bulky. Made from silk blend, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. A reinforced neckline and double-stitched seams are built to handle daily wear. It''s built for rotation — as comfortable running errands as it is out for the evening. Machine wash cold, hang to dry.', 'XR-WTP-020', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000021', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Turtleneck Knit Top | X-Rare', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Turtleneck Knit Top moves easily from day to night. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered,', now());
