  ('d41672c5-1d53-425c-893a-39aad13bff14', 'denim-mini-skirt-wsk002', 'Denim Mini Skirt', 'Designed with intention, the Denim Mini Skirt balances clean lines with real wearability. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straight body for an easy, unforced fit. Made from denim, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. A reinforced neckline and double-stitched seams are built to handle daily wear. A dependable piece for regular wear, built to outlast a single season. Machine wash cold, hang to dry.', 'XR-WSK-002', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000022', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Denim Mini Skirt | X-Rare', 'Designed with intention, the Denim Mini Skirt balances clean lines with real wearability. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straight body for an e', now());
