  ('51081bf0-8dcd-44fc-9209-dd7da7524e64', 'leather-look-skirt-wsk004', 'Leather Look Skirt', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Leather Look Skirt pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. The fit is relaxed through the body without feeling oversized, so it layers cleanly under outerwear or stands alone. Made from faux leather, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Considered hardware and a tonal color palette keep the piece easy to style. A dependable piece for regular wear, built to outlast a single season. Spot clean or dry clean recommended to preserve shape and color.', 'XR-WSK-004', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000022', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Leather Look Skirt | X-Rare', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Leather Look Skirt pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. The fit is relaxed through the body without feel', now());
