  ('9839435c-ed21-4cdf-8bf4-04093dc7c28e', 'asymmetric-hem-skirt-wsk007', 'Asymmetric Hem Skirt', 'Designed with intention, the Asymmetric Hem Skirt balances clean lines with real wearability. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, never bulky. Made from satin, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Flat-felled seams and a clean interior finish reflect the attention paid to construction most people never see. A dependable piece for regular wear, built to outlast a single season. Machine wash cold, hang to dry.', 'XR-WSK-007', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000022', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Asymmetric Hem Skirt | X-Rare', 'Designed with intention, the Asymmetric Hem Skirt balances clean lines with real wearability. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered,', now());
