  ('74a3bfcd-129a-4b59-b6bc-a68b31792604', 'knit-midi-skirt-wsk012', 'Knit Midi Skirt', 'The Knit Midi Skirt takes a familiar silhouette and refines it with careful proportions. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, never bulky. Made from ribbed knit, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. A reinforced neckline and double-stitched seams are built to handle daily wear. A dependable piece for regular wear, built to outlast a single season. Machine wash cold with like colors; tumble dry low.', 'XR-WSK-012', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000022', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Knit Midi Skirt | X-Rare', 'The Knit Midi Skirt takes a familiar silhouette and refines it with careful proportions. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, neve', now());
