  ('ea2ca39f-78ef-44df-853b-2c210a468205', 'cropped-zip-hoodie-whd001', 'Cropped Zip Hoodie', 'The Cropped Zip Hoodie brings a considered, easy confidence to everyday dressing. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, never bulky. Made from cotton fleece, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Clean seaming, a reinforced hem, and minimal branding keep the focus on the cut. A dependable piece for regular wear, built to outlast a single season. Machine wash cold with like colors; tumble dry low.', 'XR-WHD-001', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000035', ARRAY['streetwear','limited']::text[], 'Cropped Zip Hoodie | X-Rare', 'The Cropped Zip Hoodie brings a considered, easy confidence to everyday dressing. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, never bulky', now());
