  ('d312d5e2-ff89-45e9-9d34-0e9ac2176ca4', 'washed-fleece-hoodie-whd005', 'Washed Fleece Hoodie', 'The Washed Fleece Hoodie brings a considered, easy confidence to everyday dressing. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, never bulky. Made from brushed fleece, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Subtle contrast stitching and a tonal interior label round out the construction. A dependable piece for regular wear, built to outlast a single season. Machine wash cold, hang to dry.', 'XR-WHD-005', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000035', ARRAY['streetwear']::text[], 'Washed Fleece Hoodie | X-Rare', 'The Washed Fleece Hoodie brings a considered, easy confidence to everyday dressing. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, never bul', now());
