  ('a002a0cc-9cee-4167-b185-3b6f01205400', 'graphic-logo-hoodie-whd006', 'Graphic Logo Hoodie', 'Designed with intention, the Graphic Logo Hoodie balances clean lines with real wearability. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straight body for an easy, unforced fit. Made from french terry, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Clean seaming, a reinforced hem, and minimal branding keep the focus on the cut. It''s built for rotation — as comfortable running errands as it is out for the evening. Hand wash cold and lay flat to dry to keep its finish.', 'XR-WHD-006', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000035', ARRAY['streetwear']::text[], 'Graphic Logo Hoodie | X-Rare', 'Designed with intention, the Graphic Logo Hoodie balances clean lines with real wearability. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straight body for a', now());
