  ('c117fa0e-f45e-4c2b-8211-6dd6b597e827', 'drawstring-waist-hoodie-whd007', 'Drawstring Waist Hoodie', 'The Drawstring Waist Hoodie brings a considered, easy confidence to everyday dressing. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straight body for an easy, unforced fit. Made from cotton fleece, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Clean seaming, a reinforced hem, and minimal branding keep the focus on the cut. Wear it as the foundation of an everyday look or dress it up for something more considered. Spot clean or dry clean recommended to preserve shape and color.', 'XR-WHD-007', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000035', ARRAY['streetwear','sale']::text[], 'Drawstring Waist Hoodie | X-Rare', 'The Drawstring Waist Hoodie brings a considered, easy confidence to everyday dressing. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straight body for an easy', now());
