  ('46b18ce8-f84e-4ae2-83d0-6822de26e351', 'half-zip-hoodie-whd008', 'Half-Zip Hoodie', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Half-Zip Hoodie moves easily from day to night. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, never bulky. Made from brushed fleece, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Subtle contrast stitching and a tonal interior label round out the construction. A dependable piece for regular wear, built to outlast a single season. Spot clean or dry clean recommended to preserve shape and color.', 'XR-WHD-008', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000035', ARRAY['streetwear']::text[], 'Half-Zip Hoodie | X-Rare', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Half-Zip Hoodie moves easily from day to night. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, nev', now());
