  ('0f7634f4-9543-4d88-86e3-2112088407ca', 'colorblock-hoodie-whd009', 'Colorblock Hoodie', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Colorblock Hoodie moves easily from day to night. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, never bulky. Made from french terry, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Subtle contrast stitching and a tonal interior label round out the construction. Layer it into a full look or let it stand on its own; either way it holds its shape. Machine wash cold, hang to dry.', 'XR-WHD-009', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000035', ARRAY['streetwear']::text[], 'Colorblock Hoodie | X-Rare', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Colorblock Hoodie moves easily from day to night. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, n', now());
