  ('dd83e189-ac1e-4d5f-8bac-f669e51a8a6e', 'sherpa-lined-hoodie-whd011', 'Sherpa-Lined Hoodie', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Sherpa-Lined Hoodie pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. Tailored through the waist and hip for a fit that reads polished rather than fussy. Made from brushed fleece, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Considered hardware and a tonal color palette keep the piece easy to style. A dependable piece for regular wear, built to outlast a single season. Machine wash cold with like colors; tumble dry low.', 'XR-WHD-011', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000035', ARRAY['streetwear']::text[], 'Sherpa-Lined Hoodie | X-Rare', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Sherpa-Lined Hoodie pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. Tailored through the waist and hip for a fit th', now());
