  ('c0512ad2-f2e1-4607-bc5e-d0705e768932', 'two-tone-hoodie-whd012', 'Two-Tone Hoodie', 'The Two-Tone Hoodie brings a considered, easy confidence to everyday dressing. An oversized cut through the body gives room to move while keeping the silhouette deliberate, not sloppy. Made from french terry, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Considered hardware and a tonal color palette keep the piece easy to style. A dependable piece for regular wear, built to outlast a single season. Hand wash cold and lay flat to dry to keep its finish.', 'XR-WHD-012', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000035', ARRAY['streetwear']::text[], 'Two-Tone Hoodie | X-Rare', 'The Two-Tone Hoodie brings a considered, easy confidence to everyday dressing. An oversized cut through the body gives room to move while keeping the silho', now());
