  ('5bab6d7a-3dcc-4899-aa42-7feddcb77217', 'cropped-sleeveless-hoodie-whd013', 'Cropped Sleeveless Hoodie', 'The Cropped Sleeveless Hoodie takes a familiar silhouette and refines it with careful proportions. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, never bulky. Made from cotton fleece, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Clean seaming, a reinforced hem, and minimal branding keep the focus on the cut. Layer it into a full look or let it stand on its own; either way it holds its shape. Machine wash cold with like colors; tumble dry low.', 'XR-WHD-013', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000035', ARRAY['streetwear']::text[], 'Cropped Sleeveless Hoodie | X-Rare', 'The Cropped Sleeveless Hoodie takes a familiar silhouette and refines it with careful proportions. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and consid', now());
