  ('8ff69a54-8186-4d71-b014-1fc6ca6984bc', 'fitted-baby-tee-wte001', 'Fitted Baby Tee', 'Designed with intention, the Fitted Baby Tee balances clean lines with real wearability. Tailored through the waist and hip for a fit that reads polished rather than fussy. Made from cotton, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Considered hardware and a tonal color palette keep the piece easy to style. A dependable piece for regular wear, built to outlast a single season. Machine wash cold with like colors; tumble dry low.', 'XR-WTE-001', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000034', ARRAY['slim']::text[], 'Fitted Baby Tee | X-Rare', 'Designed with intention, the Fitted Baby Tee balances clean lines with real wearability. Tailored through the waist and hip for a fit that reads polished r', now());
