  ('da9bb4e5-0f53-4255-984e-89ac96f848d9', 'oversized-boyfriend-tee-wte002', 'Oversized Boyfriend Tee', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Oversized Boyfriend Tee moves easily from day to night. The fit is relaxed through the body without feeling oversized, so it layers cleanly under outerwear or stands alone. Made from slub cotton, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. A reinforced neckline and double-stitched seams are built to handle daily wear. A dependable piece for regular wear, built to outlast a single season. Hand wash cold and lay flat to dry to keep its finish.', 'XR-WTE-002', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000034', ARRAY['oversized']::text[], 'Oversized Boyfriend Tee | X-Rare', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Oversized Boyfriend Tee moves easily from day to night. The fit is relaxed through the body without feeling overs', now());
