  ('a8888983-c5d7-4623-b139-3159ab8d673c', 'twist-front-tee-wte005', 'Twist Front Tee', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Twist Front Tee moves easily from day to night. Tailored through the waist and hip for a fit that reads polished rather than fussy. Made from cotton, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Subtle contrast stitching and a tonal interior label round out the construction. Wear it as the foundation of an everyday look or dress it up for something more considered. Machine wash cold with like colors; tumble dry low.', 'XR-WTE-005', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000034', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Twist Front Tee | X-Rare', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Twist Front Tee moves easily from day to night. Tailored through the waist and hip for a fit that reads polished ', now());
