  ('f9fefb6c-9f02-4ec3-ba2c-0a5b8c0b6189', 'muscle-tank-tee-wte006', 'Muscle Tank Tee', 'The Muscle Tank Tee brings a considered, easy confidence to everyday dressing. An oversized cut through the body gives room to move while keeping the silhouette deliberate, not sloppy. Made from slub cotton, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Subtle contrast stitching and a tonal interior label round out the construction. Layer it into a full look or let it stand on its own; either way it holds its shape. Spot clean or dry clean recommended to preserve shape and color.', 'XR-WTE-006', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000034', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Muscle Tank Tee | X-Rare', 'The Muscle Tank Tee brings a considered, easy confidence to everyday dressing. An oversized cut through the body gives room to move while keeping the silho', now());
