  ('58194bd8-00e5-4b19-86d2-4c016e0de048', 'longline-tee-wte007', 'Longline Tee', 'The Longline Tee takes a familiar silhouette and refines it with careful proportions. The fit is relaxed through the body without feeling oversized, so it layers cleanly under outerwear or stands alone. Made from cotton blend, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Flat-felled seams and a clean interior finish reflect the attention paid to construction most people never see. It''s built for rotation — as comfortable running errands as it is out for the evening. Spot clean or dry clean recommended to preserve shape and color.', 'XR-WTE-007', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000034', ARRAY['sale','limited']::text[], 'Longline Tee | X-Rare', 'The Longline Tee takes a familiar silhouette and refines it with careful proportions. The fit is relaxed through the body without feeling oversized, so it ', now());
