  ('06f382b9-178c-4a54-8cd5-9d602b38d4db', 'washed-graphic-tee-wte008', 'Washed Graphic Tee', 'The Washed Graphic Tee takes a familiar silhouette and refines it with careful proportions. Tailored through the waist and hip for a fit that reads polished rather than fussy. Made from pima cotton, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Considered hardware and a tonal color palette keep the piece easy to style. Wear it as the foundation of an everyday look or dress it up for something more considered. Machine wash cold with like colors; tumble dry low.', 'XR-WTE-008', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000034', ARRAY['limited']::text[], 'Washed Graphic Tee | X-Rare', 'The Washed Graphic Tee takes a familiar silhouette and refines it with careful proportions. Tailored through the waist and hip for a fit that reads polishe', now());
