  ('4486fc2c-684b-422d-b50c-83151865a76b', 'cut-out-tee-wte010', 'Cut-Out Tee', 'Designed with intention, the Cut-Out Tee balances clean lines with real wearability. The fit is relaxed through the body without feeling oversized, so it layers cleanly under outerwear or stands alone. Made from slub cotton, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Clean seaming, a reinforced hem, and minimal branding keep the focus on the cut. Layer it into a full look or let it stand on its own; either way it holds its shape. Spot clean or dry clean recommended to preserve shape and color.', 'XR-WTE-010', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000034', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Cut-Out Tee | X-Rare', 'Designed with intention, the Cut-Out Tee balances clean lines with real wearability. The fit is relaxed through the body without feeling oversized, so it l', now());
