  ('cbeb75cb-0449-4e50-a3e1-647d94c44cb7', 'raw-edge-crop-tee-wte013', 'Raw Edge Crop Tee', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Raw Edge Crop Tee moves easily from day to night. Tailored through the waist and hip for a fit that reads polished rather than fussy. Made from cotton, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Considered hardware and a tonal color palette keep the piece easy to style. Wear it as the foundation of an everyday look or dress it up for something more considered. Machine wash cold with like colors; tumble dry low.', 'XR-WTE-013', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000034', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Raw Edge Crop Tee | X-Rare', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Raw Edge Crop Tee moves easily from day to night. Tailored through the waist and hip for a fit that reads polishe', now());
