  ('ad92201d-7c50-4d22-ac7e-596f26c10f5e', 'wide-leg-co-ord-set-wst005', 'Wide-Leg Co-Ord Set', 'The Wide-Leg Co-Ord Set takes a familiar silhouette and refines it with careful proportions. Tailored through the waist and hip for a fit that reads polished rather than fussy. Made from satin, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. A reinforced neckline and double-stitched seams are built to handle daily wear. Wear it as the foundation of an everyday look or dress it up for something more considered. Machine wash cold with like colors; tumble dry low.', 'XR-WST-005', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000036', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Wide-Leg Co-Ord Set | X-Rare', 'The Wide-Leg Co-Ord Set takes a familiar silhouette and refines it with careful proportions. Tailored through the waist and hip for a fit that reads polish', now());
