  ('19a9af3c-c031-47f0-b155-17465cce203f', 'cropped-blazer-set-wst006', 'Cropped Blazer Set', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Cropped Blazer Set moves easily from day to night. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, never bulky. Made from ribbed knit, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Subtle contrast stitching and a tonal interior label round out the construction. Wear it as the foundation of an everyday look or dress it up for something more considered. Spot clean or dry clean recommended to preserve shape and color.', 'XR-WST-006', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000036', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Cropped Blazer Set | X-Rare', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Cropped Blazer Set moves easily from day to night. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, ', now());
