  ('0594b781-915e-4731-bdcb-8f15ceb23c3a', 'terry-lounge-set-wst007', 'Terry Lounge Set', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Terry Lounge Set pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. An oversized cut through the body gives room to move while keeping the silhouette deliberate, not sloppy. Made from terry, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Subtle contrast stitching and a tonal interior label round out the construction. It''s built for rotation — as comfortable running errands as it is out for the evening. Spot clean or dry clean recommended to preserve shape and color.', 'XR-WST-007', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000036', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Terry Lounge Set | X-Rare', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Terry Lounge Set pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. An oversized cut through the body gives room to mo', now());
