  ('166a2a31-ffba-4b41-b8dd-66d6f7729adc', 'linen-co-ord-set-wst010', 'Linen Co-Ord Set', 'Designed with intention, the Linen Co-Ord Set balances clean lines with real wearability. An oversized cut through the body gives room to move while keeping the silhouette deliberate, not sloppy. Made from satin, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. A reinforced neckline and double-stitched seams are built to handle daily wear. A dependable piece for regular wear, built to outlast a single season. Machine wash cold with like colors; tumble dry low.', 'XR-WST-010', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000036', ARRAY['sale','limited']::text[], 'Linen Co-Ord Set | X-Rare', 'Designed with intention, the Linen Co-Ord Set balances clean lines with real wearability. An oversized cut through the body gives room to move while keepin', now());
