  ('dba89a58-fde7-4aec-90b7-5a0cd3001bb4', 'cropped-denim-jacket-wjk001', 'Cropped Denim Jacket', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Cropped Denim Jacket moves easily from day to night. An oversized cut through the body gives room to move while keeping the silhouette deliberate, not sloppy. Made from denim, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Considered hardware and a tonal color palette keep the piece easy to style. It''s built for rotation — as comfortable running errands as it is out for the evening. Hand wash cold and lay flat to dry to keep its finish.', 'XR-WJK-001', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000037', ARRAY['premium']::text[], 'Cropped Denim Jacket | X-Rare', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Cropped Denim Jacket moves easily from day to night. An oversized cut through the body gives room to move while k', now());
