  ('deebcb86-8d1a-4ab3-a42f-9feafe967ade', 'faux-leather-biker-jacket-wjk002', 'Faux Leather Biker Jacket', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Faux Leather Biker Jacket pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. Tailored through the waist and hip for a fit that reads polished rather than fussy. Made from faux leather, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Considered hardware and a tonal color palette keep the piece easy to style. It''s built for rotation — as comfortable running errands as it is out for the evening. Spot clean or dry clean recommended to preserve shape and color.', 'XR-WJK-002', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000037', ARRAY['premium']::text[], 'Faux Leather Biker Jacket | X-Rare', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Faux Leather Biker Jacket pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. Tailored through the waist and hip for a ', now());
