  ('7fb9a8c7-bf68-4e91-9c85-ccb9171ff8da', 'oversized-blazer-wjk003', 'Oversized Blazer', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Oversized Blazer pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. Tailored through the waist and hip for a fit that reads polished rather than fussy. Made from wool blend, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. A reinforced neckline and double-stitched seams are built to handle daily wear. Layer it into a full look or let it stand on its own; either way it holds its shape. Machine wash cold with like colors; tumble dry low.', 'XR-WJK-003', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000037', ARRAY['premium','oversized']::text[], 'Oversized Blazer | X-Rare', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Oversized Blazer pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. Tailored through the waist and hip for a fit that ', now());
