  ('135d1824-c42a-4405-a33c-416f21b0bbe2', 'tailored-trench-coat-wjk005', 'Tailored Trench Coat', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Tailored Trench Coat moves easily from day to night. An oversized cut through the body gives room to move while keeping the silhouette deliberate, not sloppy. Made from tweed, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Subtle contrast stitching and a tonal interior label round out the construction. Wear it as the foundation of an everyday look or dress it up for something more considered. Machine wash cold with like colors; tumble dry low.', 'XR-WJK-005', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000037', ARRAY['premium','sale']::text[], 'Tailored Trench Coat | X-Rare', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Tailored Trench Coat moves easily from day to night. An oversized cut through the body gives room to move while k', now());
