  ('a7a5164c-34af-40bc-9b04-50c4675387f5', 'teddy-borg-jacket-wjk006', 'Teddy Borg Jacket', 'The Teddy Borg Jacket takes a familiar silhouette and refines it with careful proportions. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straight body for an easy, unforced fit. Made from shearling, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Considered hardware and a tonal color palette keep the piece easy to style. Wear it as the foundation of an everyday look or dress it up for something more considered. Machine wash cold, hang to dry.', 'XR-WJK-006', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000037', ARRAY['premium']::text[], 'Teddy Borg Jacket | X-Rare', 'The Teddy Borg Jacket takes a familiar silhouette and refines it with careful proportions. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straight body for an ', now());
