  ('ad4430fd-ba9a-44fd-a1a2-f63289faaf55', 'longline-parka-wjk010', 'Longline Parka', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Longline Parka pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, never bulky. Made from nylon, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Considered hardware and a tonal color palette keep the piece easy to style. Layer it into a full look or let it stand on its own; either way it holds its shape. Machine wash cold, hang to dry.', 'XR-WJK-010', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000037', ARRAY['premium']::text[], 'Longline Parka | X-Rare', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Longline Parka pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and co', now());
