  ('b4eb43df-74db-4cf6-821f-a154c7f6ef6b', 'cropped-bomber-jacket-wjk011', 'Cropped Bomber Jacket', 'Designed with intention, the Cropped Bomber Jacket balances clean lines with real wearability. Tailored through the waist and hip for a fit that reads polished rather than fussy. Made from tweed, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Flat-felled seams and a clean interior finish reflect the attention paid to construction most people never see. Layer it into a full look or let it stand on its own; either way it holds its shape. Hand wash cold and lay flat to dry to keep its finish.', 'XR-WJK-011', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000037', ARRAY['premium']::text[], 'Cropped Bomber Jacket | X-Rare', 'Designed with intention, the Cropped Bomber Jacket balances clean lines with real wearability. Tailored through the waist and hip for a fit that reads poli', now());
