  ('a11d423e-b869-41aa-846e-59611f2a70f7', 'wide-leg-tailored-trouser-wpn001', 'Wide-Leg Tailored Trouser', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Wide-Leg Tailored Trouser moves easily from day to night. An oversized cut through the body gives room to move while keeping the silhouette deliberate, not sloppy. Made from cotton twill, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Subtle contrast stitching and a tonal interior label round out the construction. Layer it into a full look or let it stand on its own; either way it holds its shape. Machine wash cold with like colors; tumble dry low.', 'XR-WPN-001', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000038', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Wide-Leg Tailored Trouser | X-Rare', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Wide-Leg Tailored Trouser moves easily from day to night. An oversized cut through the body gives room to move wh', now());
