  ('80db4342-5430-4600-9797-9f14407c493f', 'high-waisted-straight-pant-wpn002', 'High-Waisted Straight Pant', 'Designed with intention, the High-Waisted Straight Pant balances clean lines with real wearability. An oversized cut through the body gives room to move while keeping the silhouette deliberate, not sloppy. Made from satin, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Clean seaming, a reinforced hem, and minimal branding keep the focus on the cut. It''s built for rotation — as comfortable running errands as it is out for the evening. Spot clean or dry clean recommended to preserve shape and color.', 'XR-WPN-002', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000038', ARRAY[]::text[], 'High-Waisted Straight Pant | X-Rare', 'Designed with intention, the High-Waisted Straight Pant balances clean lines with real wearability. An oversized cut through the body gives room to move wh', now());
