  ('ab76f86a-717a-44a1-b10f-b4231f8f748d', 'pleated-wide-leg-pant-wpn003', 'Pleated Wide-Leg Pant', 'Designed with intention, the Pleated Wide-Leg Pant balances clean lines with real wearability. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straight body for an easy, unforced fit. Made from ribbed knit, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Considered hardware and a tonal color palette keep the piece easy to style. Layer it into a full look or let it stand on its own; either way it holds its shape. Machine wash cold with like colors; tumble dry low.', 'XR-WPN-003', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000038', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Pleated Wide-Leg Pant | X-Rare', 'Designed with intention, the Pleated Wide-Leg Pant balances clean lines with real wearability. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straight body for', now());
