  ('53bc246f-e047-4ee5-a7ee-d30a08e4150f', 'cargo-utility-pant-wpn004', 'Cargo Utility Pant', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Cargo Utility Pant moves easily from day to night. The fit is relaxed through the body without feeling oversized, so it layers cleanly under outerwear or stands alone. Made from linen blend, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Subtle contrast stitching and a tonal interior label round out the construction. Layer it into a full look or let it stand on its own; either way it holds its shape. Machine wash cold, hang to dry.', 'XR-WPN-004', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000038', ARRAY['limited']::text[], 'Cargo Utility Pant | X-Rare', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Cargo Utility Pant moves easily from day to night. The fit is relaxed through the body without feeling oversized,', now());
