  ('12b1c1cd-ae5c-45ee-a7da-a66a03de62ad', 'cropped-straight-pant-wpn005', 'Cropped Straight Pant', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Cropped Straight Pant moves easily from day to night. The fit is relaxed through the body without feeling oversized, so it layers cleanly under outerwear or stands alone. Made from faux leather, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Clean seaming, a reinforced hem, and minimal branding keep the focus on the cut. Wear it as the foundation of an everyday look or dress it up for something more considered. Hand wash cold and lay flat to dry to keep its finish.', 'XR-WPN-005', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000038', ARRAY['limited']::text[], 'Cropped Straight Pant | X-Rare', 'Cut for a modern, versatile wardrobe, the Cropped Straight Pant moves easily from day to night. The fit is relaxed through the body without feeling oversiz', now());
