  ('cae38313-73cf-4f05-ae98-72aaa753e6ec', 'ribbed-flare-pant-wpn007', 'Ribbed Flare Pant', 'The Ribbed Flare Pant takes a familiar silhouette and refines it with careful proportions. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, never bulky. Made from satin, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Considered hardware and a tonal color palette keep the piece easy to style. A dependable piece for regular wear, built to outlast a single season. Spot clean or dry clean recommended to preserve shape and color.', 'XR-WPN-007', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000038', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Ribbed Flare Pant | X-Rare', 'The Ribbed Flare Pant takes a familiar silhouette and refines it with careful proportions. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, ne', now());
