  ('ef19c7c0-bc73-480c-b163-07269320bb9e', 'tapered-ankle-pant-wpn008', 'Tapered Ankle Pant', 'The Tapered Ankle Pant brings a considered, easy confidence to everyday dressing. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, never bulky. Made from ribbed knit, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Subtle contrast stitching and a tonal interior label round out the construction. A dependable piece for regular wear, built to outlast a single season. Machine wash cold with like colors; tumble dry low.', 'XR-WPN-008', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000038', ARRAY['slim']::text[], 'Tapered Ankle Pant | X-Rare', 'The Tapered Ankle Pant brings a considered, easy confidence to everyday dressing. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, never bulky', now());
