  ('fa7d7bdb-65a1-47ea-a249-f925f48e7c87', 'linen-blend-trouser-wpn009', 'Linen Blend Trouser', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Linen Blend Trouser pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. An oversized cut through the body gives room to move while keeping the silhouette deliberate, not sloppy. Made from linen blend, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Clean seaming, a reinforced hem, and minimal branding keep the focus on the cut. It''s built for rotation — as comfortable running errands as it is out for the evening. Machine wash cold with like colors; tumble dry low.', 'XR-WPN-009', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000038', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Linen Blend Trouser | X-Rare', 'A staple built to be worn often, the Linen Blend Trouser pairs effortlessly with the rest of your rotation. An oversized cut through the body gives room to', now());
