  ('fbe175ca-30e8-401e-8120-ea0f8c5aba2c', 'paperbag-waist-pant-wpn010', 'Paperbag Waist Pant', 'The Paperbag Waist Pant takes a familiar silhouette and refines it with careful proportions. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, never bulky. Made from faux leather, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Considered hardware and a tonal color palette keep the piece easy to style. Layer it into a full look or let it stand on its own; either way it holds its shape. Machine wash cold with like colors; tumble dry low.', 'XR-WPN-010', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000038', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Paperbag Waist Pant | X-Rare', 'The Paperbag Waist Pant takes a familiar silhouette and refines it with careful proportions. A true-to-size cut keeps the silhouette clean and considered, ', now());
