  ('69b21e9e-e388-4103-9fbd-600e5c481197', 'faux-leather-pant-wpn012', 'Faux Leather Pant', 'Designed with intention, the Faux Leather Pant balances clean lines with real wearability. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straight body for an easy, unforced fit. Made from satin, it holds its shape wash after wash and softens with wear. Flat-felled seams and a clean interior finish reflect the attention paid to construction most people never see. Wear it as the foundation of an everyday look or dress it up for something more considered. Machine wash cold with like colors; tumble dry low.', 'XR-WPN-012', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000038', ARRAY[]::text[], 'Faux Leather Pant | X-Rare', 'Designed with intention, the Faux Leather Pant balances clean lines with real wearability. Cut with a slightly dropped shoulder and a straight body for an ', now());
