  ('25aa58f9-6c82-4140-8040-59e095de69cd', 'classic-baseball-cap-acp001', 'Classic Baseball Cap', 'The Classic Baseball Cap is a finishing touch built to earn a permanent place in daily rotation. Made from cotton twill, it''s built to handle daily use without losing its finish. The construction favors longevity over trend — this is meant to be a repeat piece, not a one-season buy. It works equally well as a everyday piece or as the detail that finishes a considered outfit. Machine wash cold, lay flat to dry.', 'XR-ACP-001', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000039', ARRAY['unisex','streetwear','essential']::text[], 'Classic Baseball Cap | X-Rare', 'The Classic Baseball Cap is a finishing touch built to earn a permanent place in daily rotation. Made from cotton twill, it''s built to handle daily use wit', now());
