  ('b47db28c-b3ce-461e-af5b-e4cda1f2ee36', 'patterned-socks-3-pack-ask010', 'Patterned Socks (3-Pack)', 'The Patterned Socks (3-Pack) is a finishing touch built to earn a permanent place in daily rotation. Made from cotton blend, it''s built to handle daily use without losing its finish. The construction favors longevity over trend — this is meant to be a repeat piece, not a one-season buy. A practical, wearable accessory designed to be reached for often, not saved for best. Machine wash cold, lay flat to dry.', 'XR-ASK-010', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000043', ARRAY['unisex']::text[], 'Patterned Socks (3-Pack) | X-Rare', 'The Patterned Socks (3-Pack) is a finishing touch built to earn a permanent place in daily rotation. Made from cotton blend, it''s built to handle daily use', now());
