  ('7f0f6b28-74c3-4947-8e58-beb56546c7c0', 'reversible-leather-belt-als002', 'Reversible Leather Belt', 'The Reversible Leather Belt is made to be used, not just displayed — durable where it counts. Made from faux leather, it''s built to handle daily use without losing its finish. Finished with minimal branding and clean edges, it pairs with almost anything already in your wardrobe. Pack it, wear it daily, or save it for the pieces that need one final layer of polish. Store in a dry place away from direct sunlight.', 'XR-ALS-002', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000044', ARRAY['unisex']::text[], 'Reversible Leather Belt | X-Rare', 'The Reversible Leather Belt is made to be used, not just displayed — durable where it counts. Made from faux leather, it''s built to handle daily use withou', now());
