  ('3d84b9b3-6cb8-4869-83cb-de28b837a930', 'woven-canvas-belt-als003', 'Woven Canvas Belt', 'Simple by design, the Woven Canvas Belt is the kind of detail that pulls a whole look together. Made from faux leather, it''s built to handle daily use without losing its finish. The construction favors longevity over trend — this is meant to be a repeat piece, not a one-season buy. It works equally well as a everyday piece or as the detail that finishes a considered outfit. Store in a dry place away from direct sunlight.', 'XR-ALS-003', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000044', ARRAY['unisex']::text[], 'Woven Canvas Belt | X-Rare', 'Simple by design, the Woven Canvas Belt is the kind of detail that pulls a whole look together. Made from faux leather, it''s built to handle daily use with', now());
