  ('314e250c-1068-497d-8432-6a0fcbdd551a', 'woven-phone-strap-als024', 'Woven Phone Strap', 'The Woven Phone Strap is made to be used, not just displayed — durable where it counts. Made from canvas, it''s built to handle daily use without losing its finish. The construction favors longevity over trend — this is meant to be a repeat piece, not a one-season buy. A practical, wearable accessory designed to be reached for often, not saved for best. Spot clean as needed.', 'XR-ALS-024', 'active', '9bdd660c-aa2a-41fc-90b0-41aeabaabeb7', '10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000044', ARRAY['unisex']::text[], 'Woven Phone Strap | X-Rare', 'The Woven Phone Strap is made to be used, not just displayed — durable where it counts. Made from canvas, it''s built to handle daily use without losing its', now());
